  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ACEP - An Anti-corruption Initiative for Enhancing Governance and Accountability</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is aimed at increasing citizens&apos; awareness of their role in protecting electoral integrity and promoting political accountability in Ghana and to  strengthen anti-corruption initiatives by garnering long-term commitment from flagbearers and political parties to combat corruption and uphold transparency and accountability in governance.</narrative>
  </description>
